flowchart TD
    Producer[User or upstream agent<br/>OpenAPI + designs + stories + revisions]
    Intake[Intake and reconcile<br/>Pin inputs and build coverage matrix]
    Decision[Product / design / API owner<br/>Version-bound decision in conversation]
    Spec[OpenSpec change<br/>Project-resolved proposal, specs, design, tasks]
    Admission{Host adapter admission<br/>Authority + lifecycle + budgets + current artifacts}
    Implement[One frontend coding agent<br/>TypeScript / React vertical slice]
    Checks[Isolated checks<br/>Types, behavior, browser, production bundle]
    Code[Code review procedure<br/>Correctness, state, contract, accessibility]
    Perf[Performance review procedure<br/>Production assets and measured critical paths]
    Reliability[Reliability review procedure<br/>Races, failures, mutations, asset loading]
    Evidence[Versioned evidence bundle<br/>Inputs + specs + code + bundle + results]
    Gate{Completion admission<br/>Current evidence and resolved blockers?}
    Repair{Repair allowed?<br/>Budget and progress remain?}
    Output[Reviewable change + handback<br/>Verified within declared scope]
    Partial[Partial / waiting / failed / canceled<br/>Evidence, findings, next owner/action]
    Checkpoint[Durable checkpoint and runtime ledger<br/>Budgets, operations, next permitted step]
    Resume[Resume<br/>Check current rights and goal;<br/>reconcile versions and unknown effects]
    Stop[User / administrator stop or disable<br/>Deny new calls; reconcile in-flight work]

    Producer --> Intake
    Intake -->|conflict or essential gap| Decision
    Decision -->|record accepted revision| Intake
    Intake --> Spec
    Spec --> Admission
    Admission -->|admitted| Implement
    Admission -->|denied or unavailable guarantee| Partial
    Implement --> Checks
    Checks --> Code --> Perf --> Reliability --> Evidence --> Gate
    Gate -->|yes| Output
    Gate -->|finding or failed check| Repair
    Repair -->|yes: invalidate affected evidence| Admission
    Repair -->|no| Partial
    Reliability -->|unknown mutation outcome / missing semantics| Decision
    Decision -->|pending| Partial
    Spec -.-> Checkpoint
    Evidence -.-> Checkpoint
    Partial -.-> Checkpoint
    Checkpoint --> Resume --> Admission
    Stop --> Partial

    Note[Proposed architecture v0.1<br/>Sequential review roles; no persistent reviewer agents.<br/>Every tool call requires admission, including checks and reviews.<br/>Merge and deployment need separate authority.]
    Note -.-> Admission
